' Literal-only expressions fold exactly, as ZX BASIC folds them: shifts and BNOT work on whole
' numbers, / divides exactly, and a fraction is a Fixed (0.001 is 65/65536) (semantics annex:
' literal-integer-type, constant-arithmetic-literal)
'@expect screen 0 "1280 256 -257 0.125"
'@expect screen 1 "0.0009918212890625"
PRINT 5 SHL 8; " "; 1 SHL 8; " "; BNOT $100; " "; 1 / 8
PRINT 0.001
